PrintlnÆ printline
Break:
¾ It will exit from the current loop
Example Program:
public class InnerForLoop {
public static void main(String[] args) {
for (int i = 1; i <= 10; i++) {
if (i == 5) {
break;
}
System.out.println(i);
}
}}
Output:
1
2
3
4
Continue:
¾ It will skip the particular iteration
Example Program:
public class InnerForLoop {
public static void main(String[] args) {
for (int i = 1; i <= 10; i++) {
if (i == 5) {
continue;
}
System.out.println(i);

